  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"home-main\">\n    <section class=\"home-hero\">\n      <div class=\"home-hero-copy\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">RAKUTEN MOBILE SWITCHING GUIDE</p>\n        <h1>转入乐天移动，<br><span>步骤清晰，更省更安心。</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"home-hero-message\">根据您目前的运营商、地区和门店，查看办理步骤与重要注意事项。</p>\n        <p class=\"lead\">从保留原有电话号码的准备工作，到申请前需要确认的推荐优惠条件，我们为您清晰整理转网所需的信息。</p>\n        <div class=\"home-hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"https://r10.to/hNearm\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener\">查看推荐优惠条件 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n          <a class=\"home-text-link\" href=\"#area\">按地区与门店查找 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"home-start-card\">\n        <p class=\"pill\">首先确认</p>\n        <h2>转网前的3大要点</h2>\n        <ol>\n          <li><b>01</b><span>确认当前合同内容与户名</span></li>\n          <li><b>02</b><span>确认手机、邮箱及设备尾款</span></li>\n          <li><b>03</b><span>申请前确认推荐优惠条件</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"program-promo\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"section-label\">DEVICE REPLACEMENT PROGRAM</p>\n        <h2>最多免除24期手机分期付款的机制。</h2>\n        <p>48期分期、第25个月归还手机。通俗易懂地为您整理“乐天移动超值换新计划”的注意事项。</p>\n        <a class=\"button light\" href=\"/zh/guide/replacement-program/\">阅读详细讲解 →</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"program-promo-figure\" aria-label=\"48期分期付款中最多可免除24期的示意图\">\n        <div><strong>1–24</strong><span>按月付款</span></div><b>＋</b><div class=\"program-promo-saved\"><strong>25–48</strong><span>归还后最多免除24期</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"home-section carrier-section\" id=\"area\">\n      <div class=\"home-section-heading\">\n        <div><p class=\"section-label\">AREA & SHOP GUIDE</p><h2>按都道府县查找</h2></div>\n        <p>选择都道府县或从地区列表中查看附近门店指南。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prefecture-finder\">\n        <label for=\"prefecture-select\">选择都道府县</label>\n        <div class=\"prefectur